      "snippet": "ColBERT-Zero 🎯 TL;DR: First large-scale fully pre-trained ColBERT model using only public data. Achieves 55.43 nDCG@10 on BEIR benchmark, outperforming GTE-ModernColBERT and GTE-ModernBERT trained on closed and stronger data. New SOTA on BEIR for models <150M parameters. Why ColBERT-Zero? Late interaction (ColBERT / multi-vector) models have clear advantages in out-of-domain generalization ..."
